graph TD
    %% Sulfur Source Selection
    A[Sulfur Sources Available] --> B{OR: Which<br/>Sulfur Source?}
    B -->|Preferred - Sulfate| C[SO4 2-]
    B -->|Alternative - Thiosulfate| D[S2O3 2-]
    B -->|Alternative - Sulfite| E[SO3 2-]
    B -->|Organic - Cysteine| F[External Cysteine]
    
    %% Sulfate Uptake
    C --> G[CysPUWA ABC Transporter]
    G --> H{AND: ATP + Periplasmic<br/>Binding Protein?}
    H -->|No| I[\Uptake Blocked/]
    H -->|Yes| J[Sulfate Transported]
    J --> K[Cytoplasmic Sulfate]
    
    %% Sulfate Activation
    K --> L[CysD ATP Sulfurylase]
    L --> M[Sulfate + ATP]
    M --> N[Adenosine 5'-Phosphosulfate APS]
    N --> O[PPi Released]
    
    %% APS Reduction
    O --> P[CysH APS Reductase]
    P --> Q{AND: Thioredoxin<br/>Reduced?}
    Q -->|No| R[\Reduction Blocked/]
    Q -->|Yes| S[APS → Sulfite + AMP]
    S --> T[SO3 2-]
    
    %% Alternative Sulfite Entry
    E --> U[Sulfite Transport]
    U --> T
    
    %% Thiosulfate Branch
    D --> V[Thiosulfate Reductase]
    V --> W[S2O3 → SO3 + S2-]
    W --> T
    W --> X[Free Sulfide]
    
    %% Sulfite Reduction
    T --> Y[CysIJ Sulfite Reductase]
    Y --> Z{AND: NADPH + Siroheme<br/>Cofactor?}
    Z -->|No| R
    Z -->|Yes| AA[6 NADPH + SO3]
    AA --> AB[Sulfide + H2O]
    AB --> X
    
    %% O-Acetylserine Synthesis
    AC(\1) --> AD[SerA/SerB/SerC]
    AD --> AE[Serine Availability]
    AE --> AF[CysE Serine Acetyltransferase]
    AF --> AG[Serine + Acetyl-CoA]
    AG --> AH[O-Acetylserine OAS]
    AH --> AI[/N-Acetylserine/]
    
    %% Cysteine Synthase Reaction
    X --> AJ[Sulfide S2-]
    AI --> AJ
    AJ --> AK{OR: Which<br/>Synthase?}
    AK -->|CysK - Major| AL[CysK O-Acetylserine Sulfhydrylase]
    AK -->|CysM - Minor| AM[CysM O-Acetylserine Sulfhydrylase]
    
    AL --> AN[OAS + S2- → Cysteine]
    AM --> AN
    AN --> AO(\1)
    AO --> AP[Acetate Released]
    
    %% CysB Regulation
    AI --> AQ[N-Acetylserine Accumulation]
    AQ --> AR[/CysB Transcriptional Activator/]
    AR --> AS[CysB Binds N-Acetylserine]
    AS --> AT[CysB-DNA Complex]
    AT --> AU[cys Operon Activation]
    AU --> AV[CysPUWA/CysD/CysH/CysIJ Expression]
    AV --> G
    
    %% Cysteine Utilization
    AO --> AW{OR: Cysteine<br/>Fate?}
    AW -->|Protein Synthesis| AX[tRNA-Cys Charging]
    AW -->|Methionine Synthesis| AY[MetB/MetC Pathway]
    AW -->|Iron-Sulfur Clusters| AZ[IscS Cysteine Desulfurase]
    AW -->|Glutathione| BA[GSH Biosynthesis]
    
    %% Methionine Pathway
    AY --> BB[Cystathionine Intermediate]
    BB --> BC(\1)
    BC --> BD(\1)
    BD --> BE([Methionine Output])
    
    %% Fe-S Cluster Assembly
    AZ --> BF[Sulfur Transfer]
    BF --> BG[Fe-S Scaffold]
    BG --> BH[Fe-S Cluster]
    BH --> BI([Cofactor Production])
    
    %% Glutathione Synthesis
    BA --> BJ[γ-Glutamylcysteine]
    BJ --> BK[Glutathione GSH]
    BK --> BL([Antioxidant Defense])
    
    %% Protein Incorporation
    AX --> BM[Ribosomal Translation]
    BM --> BN[Cysteine in Proteins]
    BN --> BO([Disulfide Bonds/Active Sites])
    
    %% Organic Sulfur Salvage
    F --> BP[Dipeptide Uptake]
    BP --> BQ[Peptidase Cleavage]
    BQ --> AO
    
    %% Feedback Inhibition
    AO --> BR["{AND: High Cysteine<br/>AND CysB?"]
    BR -->|No| AS
    BR -->|Yes| BS[/CysB Feedback Inhibition/]
    BS --> BT[\cys Genes Repressed/]
    BT --> BU([Balanced Synthesis])
    
    I --> BV([Sulfur Starvation])
    R --> BV
    
